{%- autoescape false %}
# Marketing Signals

> Marketing Signals is a fully remote, performance-driven UK digital marketing agency for search and AI. We integrate SEO, PPC, Digital PR and Generative Engine Optimisation (GEO) into one strategy, measured on revenue and ROI — not vanity metrics. Operating since 2007, we work with ambitious brands across SaaS, finance, eCommerce, marketplaces, automotive, consumer and travel.

What sets us apart: we run SEO, PPC, Digital PR and GEO as a single compounding strategy rather than parallel silos. We're a remote-first, four-day-week agency built around senior practitioners. Our visibility work spans both classical search engines and the major generative engines — ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Gemini and Google AI Mode.
